      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1194640995,
      "text": "Trichilia emetica is a tree in the family Meliaceae, commonly known as the Natal mahogany. It is an evergreen tree, with handsome glossy dark green leaves and a wide spreading crown. Its sweet-scented flowers attract bees and birds."
    },
    "es": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (es): Trichilia emetica",
      "source_url": "https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trichilia_emetica",
